  "title": "Contango Silver & Gold Commences 40,000-meter 2026 Drill Program at the Kitsault Valley Silver-Gold Project",
  "summary": "FAIRBANKS, Alaska, May 26, 2026 /PRNewswire/ – Contango Silver & Gold Inc. (“Contango” or the “Company”) (NYSE American: CTGO) (TSX: CTGO) is pleased to announce the start of the 2026 Kitsault Valley surface drill program. Three diamond drills are currently active, focused on infill and resource expansion on the Torbrit and North Star deposits, with two more drills expected […]",
